WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.650
Lily approaches the knocked-down Ryu with raw Drive Rush.

2
00:00:00.650 --> 00:00:01.350
The down-forward heavy-punch overhead hits the recorded wakeup.

3
00:00:01.350 --> 00:00:01.700
Standing light punch follows the Rush overhead.

4
00:00:01.700 --> 00:00:03.300
Heavy Tomahawk Buster completes the overhead conversion.

5
00:00:03.300 --> 00:00:03.800
Ryu is knocked down after the overhead conversion.
